  "decision_summary": "The query is a close propofol analogue (2-isopropyl-6-(1-cyclopropylethyl)phenol). Propofol, the nearest experimental analogue, exhibits excellent brain penetration in rats with a brain:blood ratio of ~10, rapid brain entry, and brain accumulation. The cyclopropyl-for-isopropyl substitution preserves high lipophilicity and small size, so meaningful CNS access is expected.",
